---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Fable Product - Local-First AI Workspace" description="A local-first desktop workspace that keeps you in control.">
  <div class="content-page">
    <h1>The Fable Workspace</h1>
    <p class="lead">Fable is an open-source, local-first AI workspace. Core use requires no hosted account.</p>
    
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Core Architecture</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Tauri 2 + React desktop shell — <span class="status implemented">Implemented</span></li>
        <li>Encrypted SQLite vault (schema v5) — <span class="status implemented">Implemented</span></li>
        <li>BYOK native providers — <span class="status implemented">Implemented</span></li>
        <li>Windows unsigned preview builds — <span class="status preview">Preview</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <p>For a detailed breakdown of all connectors, see the <a href="/connectors">Connector Matrix</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
